{"4533690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Wizard of Gloss", "steam_appid": 4533690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.poster.avif?t=1786711310\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.webm?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.mp4?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark secrets</strong> of an interconnected satanic labyrinth.  Explore a sprawling, occult waterpark full of hidden treasures and dangerous beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the rules </strong>of movement and combat by combining upgrades in unexpected ways. Go where you're not supposed to, and find out exactly what exists in the places not on your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/33121c7d25642514173866803199b109.poster.avif?t=1786711310\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/33121c7d25642514173866803199b109.webm?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/33121c7d25642514173866803199b109.mp4?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One person's bullet hell is another's bullet heaven</strong>. Can you survive deadly encounters and unique boss battles where literally hundreds of bullets fill the screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/c7b42ebb87ce5ec0f25f569a6526b1cf.poster.avif?t=1786711310\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/c7b42ebb87ce5ec0f25f569a6526b1cf.webm?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/c7b42ebb87ce5ec0f25f569a6526b1cf.mp4?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.poster.avif?t=1786711310\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.webm?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533690/extras/752e6553ecbc83cf459feb7aa0974709.mp4?t=1786711310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark secrets</strong> of an interconnected satanic labyrinth.  Explore a sprawling, occult waterpark full of hidden treasures and dangerous beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the rules </strong>of movement and combat by combining upgrades in unexpected ways. Go where you're not supposed to, and find out exactly what exists in the places not on your map.</p><p class=\"bb_pa